that are accessible from $(x_0,t_0)$ by means of minimizing $\L$-geodesics
which remain in $\M_{\reg}$.  Assume
in addition that
$\M$ is $\kappa$-collapsed at $(x_0,t_0)$ at scale $r$, i.e.
$P(x_0,t_0,r,-r^2) \cap \M_{[t_0 - r^2, t_0)} \subset\M_{\reg}$,
