\ge 0$. \\
(c) If $\sigma(M) < 0$
 then
$\left( - \: \frac23 \: \sigma(M)
\right)^{\frac32}$ is the minimum
of the numbers
$V$ with the following property : $M$ can be decomposed as a connected sum
